                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At a time when egg prices are reaching record highs, grocery bills are hurting wallets, and American families are barely getting by, the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) is in danger of being defunded by House Republicans.\n \nSNAP helps struggling South Texans and Americans by:\n\n\ud83e\udd57 Helping kids, seniors, and veterans access high quality, nutritious food\n\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Investing in America\u2019s farmers and ranchers\n\ud83c\udfe5  Allowing families to afford their rent, utilities, or medical care",
